mission "The Meridian Star"
    name "The Meridian Star"
    description "Sink the four escorts at the Glasswater Trials, then return to Santa Isabela and report to Captain Calderon."
    source "Port de Lune"
    destination "Santa Isabela"
    reward 980
    objective kills 4
    battlefield "The Glasswater Trials" 13700 3100
    enemy "The Glasswater Trials Guard 1"
    enemy "The Glasswater Trials Guard 2"
    enemy "The Glasswater Trials Guard 3"
    enemy "The Glasswater Trials Guard 4"
    speaker offer "Harbourmaster"
    speaker visit "Harbourmaster"
    speaker complete "Harbourmaster"
    to offer
        has "The Shipwrights of Port de Lune: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `The Meridian Star is undergoing trials beyond Santa Isabela, protected by four Company escorts.`
            `The new flagship is not yet finished, but its escorts carry the heavy guns and powder that will make it formidable.`
            `The shipwrights' plans show a weak stern gallery. The Company escorts must be scattered before the flagship can be approached safely.`
            choice
                `(I will take this voyage. Tell me the course.)`
                    goto accept_job
                `(What makes this business so important?)`
                    goto more_details
                `(I have other waters to sail.)`
                    goto decline_job
            label more_details
                `The shipwrights' plans show a weak stern gallery. The Company escorts must be scattered before the flagship can be approached safely.`
                choice
                    `(Then I will see it done.)`
                        goto accept_job
                    `(Not this time.)`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `Lenoir marks the trial waters and warns you not to chase the flagship into the shallows. “Make her turn, and you will see the weakness.”`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `The officer nods and rolls the chart closed. The offer will remain here if you change your mind.`
                close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The Meridian Star. Sink the four escorts at the Glasswater Trials, then return to Santa Isabela and report to Captain Calderon."
    on visit
        conversation
            `The escorts are gone. Ashcombe has taken the Meridian Star east into the Outer Antilles, where the Company is buying a remote harbour.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `The free captains prepare to follow him beyond the usual trade routes.`
        log "Completed The Meridian Star. Received 980 gold. The free captains prepare to follow him beyond the usual trade routes."
